  <data name="Help_Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Global ({0} opens the command layer):
  G  Show the manager
  F  Show the manager and search (focus on the search box)
  L  Capture the link from the active browser
  R  Capture the path from File Explorer
  A  Open the link/path from the clipboard
  P  Save the link/path from the clipboard
  H  This help

In the list:
  Ctrl+N Add · Ctrl+E Edit · Ctrl+C Copy · Del Delete
  Ctrl+F Search · Ctrl+L Filters · F5 Reload
  Enter / double-click Open · Right-click or Shift+F10 More actions
  Ctrl+click or Shift+arrows Select several (bulk actions)

In Settings: Escape goes back to the list.</value>
